### User Login API Tests (Session-Based Authentication)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. User Login - Valid Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 2. User Login - Valid Credentials with Remember Me
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 3. User Login - Invalid Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 4. User Login - Invalid Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### 5. User Login - Missing Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 6. User Login - Missing Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 7. User Login - Empty Request Body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 8. Check Session Status (After Login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 9. Get User Profile (Session-Based)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 10. Refresh Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. Logout User (Session-Based)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 12. Check Session Status (After Logout)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 13. Try to Access Profile After Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile